TSMC demonstrates the scale and reinvestment loop available when advanced logic wins enormous demand. GlobalFoundries and Tower show how a foundry can instead concentrate on functions that do not require the smallest transistor. A strong franchise begins by choosing the dimension of performance that customers actually pay for, then building the process, capacity and trust to deliver it repeatedly.

